1
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,560
老天
Oh, God!

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,420
现在做这个有点太早了吧
It's a little early, isn't it?

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,260
继续睡吧 我不需要你醒着才能做
Go back to sleep. I don't need you awake for this.

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:08,480
亲爱的 今天是平安夜
Honey, it's Christmas Eve.

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,380
你要一整天都耗在那玩意儿上吗
Are you gonna spend all day on that thing?

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,580
我发过誓了
I made a promise.

7
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,160
没错
Yes!

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,880
去年圣诞节 菲尔买了一台椭圆健身机
Last Christmas, Phil got an elliptical machine

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,460
还发誓要在一年内走完
and vowed to walk the equivalent

10
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:20,220
相当于从我们家到加拿大的公里数
of our house to Canada in one year.

11
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,540
我这身材可不是说有就有的 女士们
This body doesn't just happen, ladies.

12
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:23,980
如果他做不到
If he didn't make it,

13
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,540
卧室里不准再放任何机器
no machine in the bedroom.

14
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,180
除了我这台机器 女士们
Except for this machine in the bedroom, ladies.

15
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,020
这些女士们到底是谁
Who are these ladies?

16
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,200
菲尔 放弃吧
Oh, Phil, give it up.

17
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,320
那你一定乐开花了吧
Oh, you would love that, wouldn't you?

18
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,820
我就快到达加拿大边境了
Just when I'm so close to the Canadian border,

19
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,480
都能闻到培根的香味
I can smell the bacon

20
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,300
还有定价合理的药品了
and the reasonably priced medications.

21
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,780
老妈 这是外婆寄给你的
Mom, this came for you from nana.

22
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,780
不知道为什么她每年都要费劲包装一下
I don't know why she bothers to wrap it every year.

23
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,340
内容永远不变 拖鞋
It's always the same thing -- slippers.

24
00:00:46,354 --> 00:00:48,946
谁知道呢 说不定她今年会给你个惊喜
You never know. She might surprise you this year.

25
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,400
你有没有兴趣
Would you care to take a visit

26
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,320
逛逛冷漠母亲博物馆
to the museum of maternal indifference?

27
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,300
小心点
Watch it!

28
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,340
小心
Oh, careful!

29
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:59,920
非要现在就搬到楼下吗
You guys are really moving her downstairs right now?

30
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:01,240
上班不会迟到吗
Aren't you gonna be late for work?

31
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:03,380
他们不会在圣诞前夕开除精灵的
They're not gonna fire an elf on Christmas Eve.

32
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,940
我以为不放鞋子 这柜子能轻点呢
Ugh, I thought this would be lighter without my shoes on it.

33
00:01:05,951 --> 00:01:07,109
等你整理好房间
You know, once you set up your room,

34
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,200
可以放些书上去
you could put books on this.

35
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,080
鞋架上放书
Books...on a shoe shelf.

36
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:11,020
想什么呢
Right.

37
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:13,960
-你不反驳一下吗 -我太开心了
- You're not gonna jump on that? - I'm just too happy!

38
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:14,880
今天过后
After today,

39
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,500
我房间里就不会再有人到处乱扔衣服
there'll be no more clothes thrown everywhere,

40
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,880
不会有人打好几个小时的电话
no more hour-long phone calls

41
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,960
全程只会说"不可能"
where all she says is "No way."

42
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:20,880
你们决定今天分开住
I think it's a little sad

43
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:22,620
我觉得有点悲伤啊
that you guys are doing this today.

44
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:25,060
我记得你们以前总是
I remember when you used to get

45
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,860
在平安夜睡同一张床
into the same bed on Christmas Eve

46
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:28,960
然后一起聊你们将得到的礼物
and talk about all the presents you were gonna get.

47
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,900
今天搬再合适不过了
It's a perfect day for it!

48
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,700
等我明天在我自己的房间醒来
When I wake up in my own room tomorrow,

49
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,380
我会感谢我获得独立
I'm going to be giving thanks for my independence.

50
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,560
那不正是圣诞节的意义所在吗
And isn't that what Christmas is all about?

51
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:39,640
真的吗 什么都不说吗
Seriously? Nothing?

52
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:55,340
这是你曾祖母的菜谱
This is your great-grandmother's recipe.

53
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:57,260
如果她现在能看到你
If she could see you now...

54
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,900
她会死第二次的 因为你弄错了
...she would die again, because you're doing it wrong!

55
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,960
我母亲来这里一星期了
My mother has been here all week.

56
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,020
我非常爱她 但你也知道常言说
I love her very much, but you know what they say --

57
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:07,260
客人待三天就开始招人烦[发臭]了
house guests start to stink after three days,

58
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:08,240
就跟尸体一样
like dead bodies.

59
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,300
那是什么玩意儿
What the hell is that?

60
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:13,820
光纤圣诞树
A fiber-optic tree.

61
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,840
这比用真正的树对环境有利
It's way better for the environment than a real one.

62
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,660
但对我家客厅这个环境就不利
Not if the environment is my living room.

63
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:20,120
我承认 这得适应一段时间
Look, I admit, it takes some getting used to,

64
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,120
但就像希腊酸奶一样
but so did greek yogurt.

65
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,360
我现在都记不清原来的酸奶是什么味道了
Now I can't even remember how the old stuff tastes.

66
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,940
人们为什么总是改变不需要改变的东西
Why do we keep changing things that don't need changing?

67
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:29,960
过圣诞节就得有真正的圣诞树 蛋酒
Christmas is real trees and eggnog,

68
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,240
佩里·科莫还有高保真音响突然的巨响
Perry Como and bing on the hi-fi.

69
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,560
你这是在瞎掰
Now you're just making up words.

70
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:34,820
我这是在表明立场
I'm drawing a line in the sand.

71
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,000
我们马上去找一棵真正的树
We're gonna get a real tree,

72
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,880
然后像我小时候那样砍倒它
and we're gonna cut it down like I did when I was a kid.

73
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:38,600
跟我来
Follow me.

74
00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:39,820
老爸
Hi, dad.

75
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,220
没空聊天 我在拯救圣诞节
Can't talk. Saving Christmas.

76
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,960
再次感谢你能来
Hi. Thank you again for coming.

77
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,120
不客气 我超爱看孩子
No problem. I love babysitting!

78
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:49,300
太好了 我们要去办点事儿
Good! We're going to run some quick errands.

79
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,720
等等 如果你要带走乔
Wait, if you're taking Joe --

80
00:02:50,729 --> 00:02:52,035
你好啊 克莱尔
Hola, Claire!

81
00:02:52,362 --> 00:02:54,843
大概四点左右回来 她很挑剔她的水瓶
Around 4:00, she gets fussy for her bottle.

82
00:02:57,100 --> 00:02:59,400
莉莉 你知道今天我为什么能
Lily, do you know why I'm able to relax

83
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,500
这么放松地看报纸吗
and read this paper today?

84
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,040
因为你没有工作吗
Because you don't have a job?

85
00:03:02,049 --> 00:03:04,791
告诉你 再过几天我就要开始新工
FYI, I am starting a new job in exactly t--

86
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,660
算了 我不再重复了
No. We're not doing this again.

87
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,620
是因为我提前计划好了
It's because I planned ahead.

88
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,500
我几周前就完成了圣诞购物
I finished my Christmas shopping weeks ago.

89
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,260
保持紧张忙碌非常重要
It's important to keep busy.

90
00:03:13,270 --> 00:03:15,727
偶尔休息一下也非常正常
I-it is perfectly normal to take some downti--

91
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,460
不 算了
No. No!

92
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,120
好吧
Okay.

93
00:03:18,129 --> 00:03:20,410
我把胡娇的派对指南打印出来了
I printed out the directions to Pepper's party.

94
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:23,820
现在改名叫"十二圣诞基佬"了
We're calling it "The 12 Gays of Christmas" now.

95
00:03:23,830 --> 00:03:24,829
我们说服他没用
Oh, just be thankful

96
00:03:24,839 --> 00:03:26,470
"快乐基男"已经要谢天谢地了
we talked him out of "Feliz Navidude."

97
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,620
好了 亲爱的 快吃完早饭
Okay, honey, finish your breakfast

98
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:29,620
我们要去帮我们的同胞了
so we can go help our fellow man!

99
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,460
去慈善活动上参与一小时 最多
One hour at this charity event, max.

100
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:33,700
我吃不了了
I can't eat.

101
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:35,860
就要得到我的胖胖狗之家了 我好激动
I'm too excited to get my Puppy Pound.

102
00:03:35,871 --> 00:03:37,469
我 抱歉 你说你的什么
I'm -- I'm sorry. Your what?

103
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,940
胖胖狗之家里有六只小狗
Puppy pounds have six puppies

104
00:03:38,951 --> 00:03:40,269
每只都有网络档案
with online profiles.

105
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,300
上网前要寻求家长同意
Ask your parents before using the Internet.

106
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:44,493
亲爱的 你从没提过什么胖胖狗之家啊
Honey, you never mentioned a-a-a puppy pound.

107
00:03:44,504 --> 00:03:46,320
-她在说什么 -礼物单上没有这个
- What is she talking about? - I-it's not on your list.

108
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:49,220
有啊 在这儿 "胖胖狗之家"
Yes, it is. "Puppy Pound."

109
00:03:49,220 --> 00:03:51,360
不是吧 她把"P"写反了
Oh, no! She put a "P" backwards.

110
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:53,200
而且亲爱的 "Pound"里有字母"u"
And, honey, there's a "u" in "Pound."

111
00:03:53,207 --> 00:03:54,946
-这写的是"古比鱼池" -古比鱼池
- This says "Guppy Pond"! - Guppy Pond!

112
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:57,220
什么是古比鱼池
What is a Guppy Pond?

113
00:03:58,094 --> 00:04:00,379
这是 有史以来最酷的礼物
It's only the -- the coolest gift ever!

114
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,620
我要胖胖狗之家
I want a Puppy Pound.

115
00:04:02,631 --> 00:04:04,563
亲爱的 今天是圣
Um, honey, it's C--

116
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:05,760
好了
Okay.

117
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,300
我不是要指责谁
I am not pointing fingers,

118
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:08,220
但我们女儿在清单上
but our daughter had

119
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:10,900
明明白白列出了一样东西
exactly one thing on her list,

120
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,360
但某人却没有买到
and someone didn't get it,

121
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:15,400
所以某人现在得去商场
so someone needs to go to the mall.

122
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:16,400
你在"指"责我
You're pointing fingers.

123
00:04:16,412 --> 00:04:18,168
不 这还是个"1"
No. It's still a "1."

124
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:20,280
只不过它偷懒睡着了
It just fell asleep on the job.

125
00:04:21,812 --> 00:04:24,500
健身日志 12月24日
Ellipticaler's log, 12/24.

126
00:04:24,669 --> 00:04:26,511
距离加拿大边界还有10英里
10 miles from Canadian border.

127
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,860
情绪高涨 精力充沛
Spirits -- high. Stamina -- strong.

128
00:04:29,264 --> 00:04:32,841
必须再来一剂大腿润滑油
Must get another application of thigh lube.

129
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,929
很好 卢克
Oh, good. Luke.

130
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,880
爸爸 走钢丝时我支持你
Dad, I was with you on the tightrope.

131
00:04:35,891 --> 00:04:38,514
吃鸡翅比赛时 我是你的搭档
I was your wing man in the wing-eating competition.

132
00:04:38,524 --> 00:04:40,280
但这次我不愿意陪着你
But I'm not feeling this one.

133
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,500
你要错过平安夜了
You're missing Christmas Eve.

134
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,880
有些东西比圣诞节更重要 儿子
There's something more important than Christmas, son

135
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:44,560
那就是自尊
-- pride.

136
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,880
如果我到不了加拿大
If I don't make it to Canada,

137
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:46,980
你妈妈获胜了 这宝贝
your mom wins, and this baby

138
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:48,640
明天一早就会被丢进车库里
ends up in the garage first thing in the morning.

139
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,700
我们家车库吗
Our garage?

140
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,520
我负责回收垃圾
I'm in charge of the recycling.

141
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,540
我该在周四早晨六点从车库
I'm supposed to bring it from the garage to the curb

142
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:56,286
拿出垃圾放在马路边
by 6:00 A.M. Thursday morning.

143
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,080
我也许错过了几周
I may have missed a few weeks.

144
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:01,900
该死
Shoot!

145
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,800
也许不止几周
Maybe more than a few weeks.

146
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:09,000
过了一阵子 垃圾堆越来越大
After a while, the pile just got so big,

147
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:10,380
我不能在前一晚把垃圾都搬出去
I couldn't bring it out the night before

148
00:05:10,388 --> 00:05:11,661
不然人们会问问题的
or people would ask questions.

149
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,620
我可不需要人们问问题
I don't need people asking questions.

150
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,420
你说得对 你得完成
Then you're right! You've got to finish!

151
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:18,680
你在车库里可用不上这个 那里风太大
You'll never use this thing in the garage! It's too drafty!

152
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:20,380
所以我才要去加拿大啊 儿子
That's why I'm going to Canada, buddy --

153
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,520
躲开大风
to avoid the draft!

154
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:23,700
不行
No.

155
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:28,420
找到了
Bang.

156
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,400
我知道我们已经走了一小时了 但是
I know we've been hiking for an hour, but...

157
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,260
这棵树多美啊 真是太值得了 对吧
worth it when you look at this beauty, huh?

158
00:05:34,540 --> 00:05:36,800
所以不要砍伐你看到的第一棵树
That's why you don't cut down the first tree you see.

159
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,700
这就是我们看到的第一棵树
This is literally the first tree we saw.

160
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:39,720
我们的车就停在那里
There's our car.

161
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,840
不 我们是从那边开始的
No, we started that way.

162
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:42,660
所以你的意思是
So, you're arguing

163
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,300
我们围着地球绕了一圈吗
that we walked entirely around the earth?

164
00:05:44,390 --> 00:05:45,640
把斧子给我
Give me the ax.

165
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,240
别那样看着我
Don't give me that look.

166
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:55,580
树就像女人一样
Trees are like women.

167
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,640
你得多费功夫 才能得到最好的
The best ones make you work a little bit harder.

168
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,840
她只是没那么喜欢你
She's just not that into you.

169
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:08,510
-就是啊 -抱歉花了这么长时间
- I know! - Sorry it too long!

170
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,920
没事啦
Oh, it's fine.

171
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:12,960
克莱尔和我聊得很开心
Claire and I were having a nice time catching up.

172
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,960
真抱歉我迟到了
I am really sorry that I am late.

173
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:16,940
你才不抱歉
No, you're not.

174
00:06:16,952 --> 00:06:17,607
的确如此
No, I'm not.

175
00:06:17,619 --> 00:06:19,328
没关系啦
Mm-hmm. It's fine.

176
00:06:19,340 --> 00:06:20,680
希望我这个话唠没烦到皮娜
Just hope I didn't talk Pilar's ear off!

177
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:21,600
没有啦
No!

178
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:24,520
我喜欢听你聊你的家人
I love hearing about your family

179
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:26,760
和你重大新工作的事
and your big, new job!

180
00:06:26,770 --> 00:06:29,270
这工作不算重大啦
Oh, well, it's -- it's not such a big job.

181
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,920
我只是在为我老爸工作而已
I mean, I'm really just working for my dad.

182
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,140
但你有努力工作啊
But you're working hard.

183
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:33,380
我为你感到骄傲
I'm proud of you.

184
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:36,986
-看起来怎么样 -完美
- How do they look? - Ooh! Perfect!

185
00:06:37,058 --> 00:06:38,625
-太棒了 -你是超棒的学生
- Yes. - You are a wonderful student.

186
00:06:38,635 --> 00:06:41,180
-谢谢 -这是我祖母教给我妈妈的
-Thank you. -My grandmother taught my mother.

187
00:06:41,180 --> 00:06:42,740
我妈妈又教给了我
My mother taught me.

188
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,860
现在我教给了克莱尔
And now, I teach Claire.

189
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,400
别谦虚啦
And don't be so modest.

190
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:49,140
我尊重那种能养育家庭
I respect a woman who can raise a family

191
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:50,760
同时又有全职工作的女人
and have a full-time job.

192
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:52,280
你能相信吗 在周五
Can you believe that on Fridays,

193
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:54,340
她们都没必要盛装打扮
they don't even have to dress up?

194
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,280
尝尝 尝尝
Taste. Taste. Taste.

195
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,640
有时她们甚至穿运动裤哦
Sometimes, they even wear sweatpants.

196
00:06:57,740 --> 00:06:59,720
你想舔一舔面糊吗
Would you like to lick the batter?

197
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:01,200
超想
Yes! Oh, yes!

198
00:07:01,209 --> 00:07:03,151
-我也想 -不行
- Me, too! - No, no, no!

199
00:07:03,323 --> 00:07:04,804
帮忙的人才能吃到
Helpers only.

200
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:07,240
规矩不是我定的
I don't make the rules.

201
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:14,280
莉莉 装饰品真漂亮
Oh, Lily, what a beautiful ornament!

202
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,460
这会让一个小朋友很开心的
That's gonna make a little kid very happy.

203
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,320
等等 我不能留着吗
Wait. I don't get to keep this?

204
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,860
为什么我还做得这么费力
Why am I killing myself?

205
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,260
好了 孩子们
Okay, kids!

206
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:23,340
北极有人来探望我们了
We've got a visitor from the North Pole,

207
00:07:23,350 --> 00:07:24,936
而且他带了礼物哦
and he brought presents!

208
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,620
喂 怎么样
Hey! Hey. How's it going?

209
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:30,300
到处都买不到胖胖狗之家
There are no Puppy Pounds anywhere.

210
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:31,840
简直就像在1983年的平安夜寻找
It's like trying to find a Cabbage Patch Kid

211
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,480
椰菜娃娃一样
on Christmas Eve 1983.

212
00:07:33,940 --> 00:07:34,900
还无法释怀呐
Still hurts, huh?

213
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,420
我把她的床都铺好了
I had her bed all made.

214
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:38,660
好吧 莉莉会难过死的
Okay. Well, Lily is gonna be devastated.

215
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:40,200
打电话问问 把我们排上预订名单
Call around. Get us on some lists.

216
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:41,400
你得做些什么
You have to do something!

217
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:42,300
我会想办法的
I'll figure it out.

218
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,720
募捐会怎么样
How's the fundraiser?

219
00:07:43,732 --> 00:07:45,588
我在设法对付
Oh, well, I'm managing, you know.

220
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,700
把支票本拿来
Oh, bring the checkbook.

221
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:48,920
能看出他们准备提出重大请求的样子
You can always tell when they're gearing up for the big ask --

222
00:07:49,172 --> 00:07:50,498
给了很多免费赠品
Fill you full of freebies.

223
00:07:50,509 --> 00:07:52,932
我得挂了 得去帮帮别人
Oh, hey, I gotta go. Got to help somebody.

224
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:55,880
你好 经典小丑
Hi! Classic.

225
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,120
扔得真完美
Flawlessly executed.

226
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:57,880
如果我有一个...
If I had one...

227
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,300
只想让你们能笑逐颜开
Just trying to bring a smile to you folks.

228
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,360
-你会度过这一切的 -度过什么
- You're gonna get through this. - Get through what?

229
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,620
别不好意思
Don't be embarrassed.

230
00:08:02,900 --> 00:08:04,480
我们都处境相同
Everyone here is in the same boat.

231
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,640
是吗
We are?

232
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,160
热可可最妙的一点
Best thing about the hot chocolate --

233
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,460
喝完后杯子也归我们
they let us keep the mug.

234
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:18,440
我以为这是为有需要的人募捐的慈善活动
I thought it was a charity event for the needy.

235
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,800
结果是让有需要人士来参加的慈善活动
Turns out, it was a charity event for the needy!

236
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:24,160
瞧 圣诞老人给了我一个胖胖狗之家
Look! Santa gave me a puppy pound!

237
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:25,220
什么 不
What? No.

238
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,520
我终于开心啦
I'm finally happy!

239
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,420
我需要给新闻报道拍张照片
I'd like a picture for the newsletter.

240
00:08:28,435 --> 00:08:30,145
你可以给你妈妈看看
Oh. You can show your mommy.

241
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,140
我没有妈妈
I don't have a mommy.

242
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,180
所以我才办这活动
This is why I do this.

243
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,780
也许不是抽筋 可能要犯心脏病
That cramp could be a heart attack.

244
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,420
我要给你留下一些建议
Here's some advice I've been holding back on.

245
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,540
刮胡子的时候要顺着皮肤纹理刮
Always shave with the grain.

246
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,740
真正有本事的地产中介
No reputable talent agent

247
00:08:43,740 --> 00:08:45,060
是不会一开始就谈钱的
will ever ask for money up-front.

248
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,040
爸 你没事的
Dad, you're fine.

249
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:47,160
卢克 我好想放弃啊
I really want to quit, Luke!

250
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:48,420
不 你可以的
No, you're gonna make it!

251
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,840
他根本不可能做到的
He was never gonna make it.

252
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:52,220
我只是要拖延时间
I just needed to buy some time.

253
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,800
你要搬的东西真够多的
That's a lot of product you're moving.

254
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,620
带到垃圾回收场就行了
Just bring it to a recycling place.

255
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:57,980
给了钱我才办事
Not until I get paid.

256
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:01,760
这可是人家六个星期的补贴呢
Just so you know, this is six weeks' allowance.

257
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:04,136
你家长真是酷毙了
Oh, you have the coolest parents ever.

258
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:06,360
我得知道你什么时候出发
I want to know when you're about to leave,

259
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,340
按一下喇叭通知我
so give me a honk.

260
00:09:08,380 --> 00:09:10,320
-嘀嘀 -按汽车的喇叭
- Honk! - From your car.

261
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:13,920
最好的名片就是有力的握手
The best business card is a firm handshake.

262
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:17,120
最好的搭讪诀窍是穿紧身工作裤
The best pick-up line is a tight pair of dockers.

263
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,665
最好的工作裤是...
The best dockers are --

264
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,920
爸爸 别说了 还有最后五英里了
Dad, save your breath! You're in the last five miles.

265
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:22,900
-我永远也跑不完了 -你当然能
- I'm never gonna make it! - Of course you are!

266
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,660
不过你爱怎么办怎么办吧 我还有事
Then again, do what you want. I got stuff to do.

267
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,820
-我要放弃了 -好吧
- I'm gonna quit. - Cool.

268
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,060
再失败一次又怎么样呢
What's one more failure?

269
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:33,000
你想过我们为什么要绕远去学校吗
You ever wonder why we take such a crazy route to school?

270
00:09:34,937 --> 00:09:36,950
因为那样我就不用路过某些地方了
So I don't have to drive by certain places --

271
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:39,500
那个我只去过一次的长笛老师家
The flute teacher's house I went to once...

272
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:42,320
那个我只学了五大基本酱料中的两种
The French cooking academy I quit after learning

273
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,780
就退出了的法餐烹饪学校
only two of the five mother sauces...

274
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,460
那个只学了一个动作就放弃了的瑜伽教室
The hot yoga studio I left after "Happy baby."

275
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:50,320
看来是怎么也躲不过
I guess there's no avoiding

276
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:52,260
车库里这个巨大的失败了
this big failure sitting in my garage.

277
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,000
起来
Get up.

278
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,180
谢谢你 伙计 不过...
I appreciate it, buddy, but --

279
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:58,220
快起来
Get up.

280
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,800
我不会你说的长笛
I don't know anything about flutes

281
00:10:00,810 --> 00:10:03,045
或者烹饪或者瑜伽...
or cooking or happy babies...

282
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:06,900
但我拼了老命也要让你去加拿大
But I'm damn sure getting my dad to Canada.

283
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,480
加油跑到终点吧
Now, mount that beast.

284
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:10,160
谢谢你 儿子
Thank you, son.

285
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:12,860
等你跑过终点开始庆祝的时候
You can thank me after you cross the finish line

286
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:14,180
再谢我
and the celebration begins.

287
00:10:14,540 --> 00:10:16,000
想象一下吧
Just picture that.

288
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:18,800
我能想象到
I'm picturing it!

289
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,640
我能想象到
I'm picturing it!

290
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:23,360
我真的能想象到
I'm really picturing it!

291
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:26,740
谢谢你 圣诞老人
Thanks, Santa.

292
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:27,880
好 没事
Yeah. You got it.

293
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:29,940
别忘了圣诞夫人给你的糖果棒
Don't forget a candy cane from Mrs. Claus!

294
00:10:29,950 --> 00:10:32,059
我得休息会儿
Oh! I got to take a break.

295
00:10:32,447 --> 00:10:34,108
-什么 -搞什么
- What? - What? What?

296
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,220
没关系
Um...it's okay!

297
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:38,020
谁想和我照张相呀
Does anybody want to take a picture with me?

298
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:40,480
-我想 -我是说孩子们
- I'll do it. - Oh, maybe just the kids.

299
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,020
-刚才怎么回事 -什么怎么回事
- What was that? - What was what?

300
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:45,620
圣诞老人不能休息
Santa doesn't take breaks.

301
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:47,140
他要去北极的
He visits the North Pole!

302
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,660
而且你怎么把这里弄得乱七八糟的
And why do you leave your things all over?

303
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,200
最后是我要打扫这里好吗
Who do you think cleans this place up?

304
00:10:51,211 --> 00:10:53,235
你怎么像祥林嫂似的
Oh, you are such a nag!

305
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,320
我们连在过节的时候
Can't we at least

306
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,120
假装是幸福的一对都不行吗
act like a happy couple during the holidays?

307
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,580
为了孩子们
For the children!

308
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,820
你还喝热巧克力
Another hot chocolate?

309
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,380
你还想喝多少杯啊
How many more of those are you going to drink?

310
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,120
至少它是暖的 不像你
At least it's warm, unlike you!

311
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:05,000
圣诞老人常在外出差
He travels a lot.

312
00:11:05,203 --> 00:11:06,908
圣诞夫人吃曲奇吃胖了
She's put on cookie weight.

313
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,740
日子不好过
It's hard.

314
00:11:08,894 --> 00:11:10,143
没问题 你可以把我放在
Yes, you can put me on

315
00:11:10,154 --> 00:11:12,069
"亡羊补牢礼物购买者"的名单上
the "Last-minute shoppers" waiting list.

316
00:11:12,081 --> 00:11:13,580
-真行 -你也在这里啊
- Unbelievable. - Oh! Well, there he is!

317
00:11:13,592 --> 00:11:14,888
乔森
H-hey, Jotham!

318
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:15,580
看来你也是
Oh, looks like someone did

319
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:17,220
临到圣诞才想起要买礼物
a little last-minute Christmas shopping.

320
00:11:17,403 --> 00:11:18,970
那个赞尼尔真是幸运啊
That Zaniel's a lucky guy.

321
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:20,200
他的确很幸运
Yes, he is.

322
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,520
但这些是要带去胡娇的派对的
But these are for Pepper's party.

323
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,100
他的请柬上不是说了不要带礼物吗
His invitation said, "No gifts, please."

324
00:11:23,112 --> 00:11:24,419
重复一遍那句话
Mm, say that again...

325
00:11:24,674 --> 00:11:26,074
用胡娇的语气
as Pepper.

326
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:26,960
没带礼物吗
No gifts?

327
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:27,900
想不想活了
Please.

328
00:11:28,349 --> 00:11:30,046
现在是平安夜的下午五点
5 o'clock, Christmas Eve,

329
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:32,600
我还得去买最完美的礼物
and I have to find a dozen perfect presents

330
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,820
给世界上最挑剔最尖刻的男人们
for the world's snarkiest, cattiest men...

331
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,780
我亲爱的朋友们
My dear, dear friends.

332
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:40,040
拉 拉 再拉
Pull! Pull! Pull!

333
00:11:40,136 --> 00:11:41,706
好了 休息会儿吧
Yeah. Hey, take a break.

334
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,400
-这也太费时了 -本来就是
- This is taking forever. - It's supposed to.

335
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:46,180
原来我和我爸要花一整天弄倒一棵树
Took my dad and I all day to get a tree.

336
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:48,500
当终于把树砍下来的时候
And when he finally brought her down,

337
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,300
他会抽根雪茄来庆祝
he used to celebrate with a cigar.

338
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:53,040
我那时还是个孩子 所以就抽根香烟
I was just a kid, so I'd have a cigarette.

339
00:11:53,662 --> 00:11:55,164
好了 抓住另一边
All right. Grab the other end.

340
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,260
这就对了
There we go.

341
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,220
这就进入状态了吧
Now we got a groove.

342
00:11:59,229 --> 00:12:00,628
好了 这就可以...
Yeah. There we --

343
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:02,900
它就是不断
It won't budge!

344
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:04,260
这木头是他妈什么做的啊
The hell is this wood made of?

345
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,480
都能拿来做锯了好吗
They ought to make saws out of it!

346
00:12:05,491 --> 00:12:07,389
面对现实吧 这棵树把我们打败了
Let's face it. The tree's beaten us.

347
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,200
我们普里契特家的人是不会半途而废的
Hey, we're Pritchetts. We don't quit.

348
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,720
再说了 我的工具都卡在里面
Besides, all my tools are stuck in it.

349
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,560
我知道该怎么办了
I got it.

350
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:17,100
非常简单的原理
It's simple physics.

351
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,460
给这棵树施点压
A little pressure,

352
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:20,580
它就会在我们砍的地方断掉
the thing will snap where we put the blade in.

353
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:21,960
-这不就完事了 -赶紧的吧
- Done. - Just hit the gas.

354
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,760
凑效了吧
It's working.

355
00:12:23,770 --> 00:12:25,175
这才叫北方汉子做的发动机
That's why they call it yankee engine--

356
00:12:25,186 --> 00:12:26,559
小心
Get down!

357
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:30,540
半棵树都秃了
It's bald on one side now!

358
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,520
没事的
It'll be fine!

359
00:12:31,940 --> 00:12:33,540
两边匀一匀就好了
We'll just comb over some branches!

360
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,740
克莱尔 我以为你走了呢
Oh, Claire, I thought that you had left.

361
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,640
她本来是要走了
She was going to,

362
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:41,680
但我想让她看看没有这些头发挡着
But I wanted to show her how much better she looks

363
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,780
她的脸 她有多美丽动人
without this hair blocking her pretty face.

364
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:46,040
她头发确实很美
She does have beautiful hair, though.

365
00:12:46,048 --> 00:12:46,982
我知道
I see.

366
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:50,140
她说什么
What did she say?

367
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:52,220
说你碰巧赶上一个好发色
That you picked a good color...

368
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,620
反正我觉得她是这个意思
At least, I think that's what she said

369
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:54,820
她美国口音太重
with that American accent.

370
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:57,660
你不用哄她高兴
You don't have to entertain her.

371
00:12:57,660 --> 00:12:59,600
毕竟她是我妈
After all, she's my mother.

372
00:13:00,348 --> 00:13:03,989
这是歌洛莉亚以前最爱吃的
Ah, these used to be Glorita's favorite!

373
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,960
她以前为了能多吃点常做手头倒立
She used to do headstands to get extra cookies.

374
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,400
至少会努力去做
At least, she'd try.

375
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:10,100
是的 真的不容易做到
Yeah, but it's not easy!

376
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:13,880
我站着的时候要保持她们坚挺都很不容易
I mean, it's hard enough to keep all this right-side up!

377
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:16,220
你可以想象倒过来会有多难
Imagine when I had to put it all right-side down!

378
00:13:16,230 --> 00:13:17,150
-那太... -天呐
- It was... - Oh, my gosh.

379
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,480
真不敢相信我还能做到
I can't believe I can still do it!

380
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,120
看呐
Look at that.

381
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:21,472
看看克莱尔 歌洛莉亚
Oh, wow. Look at Claire, Gloria!

382
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:24,140
真棒 给你两块小点心
Very good! Two cookies for you!

383
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,300
谢谢
Thank you!

384
00:13:25,310 --> 00:13:27,390
是啊 可她需要修修脚
Uh, yeah, but she needs a pedicure.

385
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,000
看呐
Look at that.

386
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,900
你把我弄倒了
You knocked me down!

387
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,800
-我没有 -有 你弄的
- I did not. - Yes, you did, too!

388
00:13:33,878 --> 00:13:37,609
姑娘们 姑娘们 别吵了
Girls! Girls! Girls! No need to fight.

389
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,940
我没有偏爱你们哪一个
I don't have a favorite.

390
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:40,680
为什么没有
Why the hell not?!

391
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:48,800
我对你们两个非常失望
I am very disappointed in both of you.

392
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:51,040
家庭成员应该用爱和尊重
Family members should treat each other

393
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,540
来对待彼此
with love and respect.

394
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:54,860
但克莱尔不是我们家的人
Except that Claire is not part of our family.

395
00:13:54,871 --> 00:13:57,229
-闭嘴 -不不
- Cierra la boca! - No. No, no.

396
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,900
她说的对 除非你刚才说的就是这个
She's right-- unless that's what you just said.

397
00:13:58,910 --> 00:14:01,047
我听不懂 因为我只学了法语
I can't tell, 'cause I-I only took French,

398
00:14:01,056 --> 00:14:02,110
能讲一点点
And je parle un peu.

399
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,980
你的语调很美啊
Oh, you have a beautiful accent.

400
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,080
真的吗 你这么觉得吗
Really? Do you think so?

401
00:14:05,090 --> 00:14:07,687
-拜托 -抱歉 我
- Ay-ya! Por favor? - I'm sorry. I...

402
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:11,420
我很嫉妒
I-I'm jealous.

403
00:14:12,993 --> 00:14:13,950
克莱尔
Ay, Claire.

404
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:17,840
你也很美 个性的美
But you're beautiful, too, in your own way.

405
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,720
不 我不是嫉妒你
No. I'm not jealous of you.

406
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:22,280
我嫉妒你妈妈
I am jealous of how your mother

407
00:14:22,280 --> 00:14:24,340
大老远从哥伦比亚来看你
comes all the way to see you from Colombia,

408
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:26,660
可我妈甚至都不愿意从她住的
When my own mother won't even get on a bus

409
00:14:26,660 --> 00:14:28,920
阿尔蒙公寓坐车过来 只有三小时路程
from the Almond co-op she lives on three hours away.

410
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,600
她会寄礼物来的 没有吗
She sends presents, no?

411
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:32,460
有寄 但每年都一样
Yeah. It's the same thing every year.

412
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,340
永远是拖鞋
It's always slippers.

413
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:34,800
我为你感到难过
I am sorry.

414
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:35,940
谢谢
Thank you.

415
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,400
但我不该因为我妈妈不好
But I shouldn't take it out on you

416
00:14:37,410 --> 00:14:38,910
就把气撒在你头上
just 'cause I have a lousy mom.

417
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,100
不许不尊重你妈妈
Don't disrespect your mother!

418
00:14:40,863 --> 00:14:42,522
-她总这样吗 -是的
- Is she always like this? - Yes.

419
00:14:42,533 --> 00:14:46,349
你就没想过也许她寄给你那样礼物
Did you-- did you ever think maybe there's a reason

420
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,200
是有原因的吗
she sends you that gift?

421
00:14:48,211 --> 00:14:49,549
想过 因为在我8岁时
Yeah, 'cause she found something

422
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:51,160
她发现了我很喜欢的礼物
when I was 8 years old that I actually liked,

423
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,840
从此就再也没花心思选礼物给我
and she hasn't thought about it since.

424
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:55,680
也许她花了很多心思
Well, maybe she thinks about it a lot.

425
00:14:56,300 --> 00:15:00,340
也许她记得她让你开心的那个时刻
Maybe she remembers a time when she made you happy,

426
00:15:00,340 --> 00:15:02,500
她想回到过去
and she wants to go back there.

427
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,820
现在我好难受
Well, now I feel terrible.

428
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:07,220
我只寄给她一张电子贺卡
The only thing I sent her was an e-card.

429
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,620
我们都不愿意承认
We don't like to admit it...

430
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:14,300
可妈妈们永远不会忘记
But mothers never get over

431
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:16,620
女儿们离开她们的那天
the day their daughters leave them.

432
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:19,940
我们从未停止对自己的女儿的依赖
We never stop needing our little girls.

433
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:24,300
我也从未停止对你的依赖 妈妈
I will never stop needing you, mama.

434
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,220
不好意思
Excuse me.

435
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:33,780
不好意思
Excuse me.

436
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:36,920
不好意思 精灵
Excuse me, elf,

437
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:38,320
已经过去45分钟了
it's been 45 minutes.

438
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,040
圣诞老人去哪了
Where's Santa?

439
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:40,180
我不知道
I don't know!

440
00:15:40,180 --> 00:15:42,580
他可能忙着为世界上所有的孩子
Maybe he's a little busy making presents

441
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:44,960
做礼物呢
for every child in the world.

442
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:46,000
等一下
One second!

443
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,260
他人呢
Where is he?

444
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:52,880
他说他要出去买一包糖果棒
He said he was going out for a pack of candy canes.

445
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,260
你是指那玩意吗
You mean like those?

446
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:59,440
好了 醒醒 他不会回来了
Okay. Wake up! He is not coming back!

447
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:02,300
我们需要换回便装
We need to change into our regular clothes

448
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:02,960
溜出去
and sneak out.

449
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:04,240
我想什么呢
Who am I kidding?

450
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,240
我的双眼是让人过目难忘的
My eyes are unforgettable.

451
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,420
我连个假丈夫都留不住
I couldn't even hold on to a fake husband.

452
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:09,860
我总认为你是难相处的人
I always thought you were the tough one to live with,

453
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:10,700
可或许我才是
but maybe I am.

454
00:16:10,940 --> 00:16:12,840
他们已经冲破了糖果围栏 问题大了
Okay, they've breached the jelly bean moat. This is a problem.

455
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:15,220
这是个大问题 我一直在等一个
It's a big problem. All this time, I've been waiting

456
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:16,320
能了解我的人
for a guy to see the true me,

457
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,460
可现在我却害怕被他看透
and now I'm scared he will.

458
00:16:17,468 --> 00:16:18,840
天呐 他们打倒布利岑了
Oh, my god! They've got Blitzen!

459
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,880
我会怎么样
What's going to happen to me?

460
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,540
我会一直挑剔别人直到人家离开我吗
Am I just going to nitpick everyone until they leave me?

461
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:25,020
-妈妈都找到对象了 -这倒是
- Hey, mom found somebody! - That's true.

462
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:26,080
好了 听着
Okay, listen.

463
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,980
我们真的得离开这里
We really need to get out of here.

464
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,080
我只想让你知道
But I just want to let you know

465
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:32,459
你不是那么难相处 我觉得
that you weren't all bad to live with. I thought--

466
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:34,460
天呐
Oh, my god!

467
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:35,320
天呐
Oh, my god!

468
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:37,420
圣诞老人呢
Where's santa?!

469
00:16:39,261 --> 00:16:40,775
只剩下一百码了
Only 100 more yards.

470
00:16:40,786 --> 00:16:42,660
你就要到达了
You're just about there!

471
00:16:42,660 --> 00:16:43,580
看到了吗
Can you see it?

472
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:46,960
未来真美好 满眼绿色
It's so beautiful. It's so green.

473
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,220
而且 好高啊
And, wow, those are high up there.

474
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:49,940
山脉吗
The mountains?

475
00:16:49,949 --> 00:16:51,260
不是 还是我的短裤
No, my shorts again.

476
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:52,671
介意最后再拉它一下吗
Would you mind giving them one last tug?

477
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,680
你穿过边境了[越界]
You're crossing the border.

478
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,349
我知道 我也不好意思问出口
Yeah, I know, and I feel bad asking,

479
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,340
可我感觉到它紧紧地包着我
But I'm tasting cotton.

480
00:16:56,351 --> 00:16:59,477
不是 你做到了 你到加拿大了
No! You did it! You're in Canada!

481
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,940
等等 什么
Wait. What?

482
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:03,860
我做到了 我做到了
I did it? I did it!

483
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,220
我做到了 我做到了
I did it! I did it!

484
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:08,700
我们快去告诉妈妈
Let's go tell mom!

485
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:11,160
等等
Wait.

486
00:17:11,173 --> 00:17:13,382
我以前是怎么走路的
How did I used to walk?

487
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:14,240
好了 宝贝儿 快来
All right. Come on, sweetie.

488
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:15,520
我们走
Let's go.

489
00:17:19,731 --> 00:17:21,160
我们提供圣诞晚餐
Uh, we're serving Christmas dinner.

490
00:17:21,171 --> 00:17:22,069
不 没关系
Uh, no. That's fine.

491
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,560
我们必须得走了
We have to actually get going, so...

492
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:25,220
可我今天还没吃过东西呢
But I haven't eaten today.

493
00:17:25,260 --> 00:17:26,000
可怜的小家伙
Oh, you poor thing!

494
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,300
她没关系的 没事
No, she's fine. She's fine.

495
00:17:28,801 --> 00:17:29,620
他来了
Oh, there he is.

496
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:31,060
亲爱的 你这外套在哪拿的
Honey, where did you get this coat?

497
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:32,260
不好意思 孩子们
Sorry, kids.

498
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:35,400
外套和玩具好像发完了
It looks like we've run out of coats and toys.

499
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:39,200
没关系 妈妈 至少我看到礼物了
That's okay, mom. At least I got to see presents.

500
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:40,640
好了 快过来 我们走
Okay. Come on. Let's go.

501
00:17:40,650 --> 00:17:42,870
我的好心人们今天过得怎么样
Hey! How are my do-gooders?

502
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:43,460
玩得开心吗
Did you have fun?

503
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,360
还行 上车再说 我的天啊
Yep. Talk about it in the car. Oh, my gosh.

504
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:47,940
这些是什么
What are these?

505
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:49,680
是啊 我是不是有点太疯狂了
Yeah, I went a little crazy, huh?

506
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,640
不 不 这是个圣诞节奇迹
No! No, no! It's a Christmas miracle!

507
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:54,660
孩子们 孩子们 谁想要礼物
Kids! Kids! Who wants presents?

508
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:55,320
小卡 你在做什么
Cam, what are you doing?

509
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:57,300
不 相信我 莉莉的礼物足够了
No, trust me. Lily has enough.

510
00:17:57,310 --> 00:18:00,023
-小卡 小卡 -大家圣诞快乐
- Cam, Cam. - Everybody, Merry Christmas!

511
00:18:02,483 --> 00:18:03,000
那个不可以
Oh! Not that one.

512
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,960
圣诞快乐
Feliz navidad!

513
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,637
好吧 可是那些不是给莉莉的
Okay, but those aren't for Lily.

514
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:08,240
"他与他的沐浴拖鞋"
"His-and-his shower clogs?"

515
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,260
这些是要带去胡娇的派对的
They're for Pepper's party.

516
00:18:09,300 --> 00:18:10,260
他说过不用带礼物的
He said, "No gifts, please."

517
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:11,740
想象一下胡娇说那句话的语气
Imagine how Pepper would say that.

518
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:14,100
"喜马拉雅盐盘"是什么东西
What's a Himalayan salt plate?

519
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:16,660
你可以一边上菜一边调味
You can season your food while you serve it. Yeah.

520
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:18,240
脂肪秤
Body-fat scale?

521
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:19,960
我像你这么大的时候很想要一个
I wish I would've had one of those when I was your age.

522
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:22,607
-不用谢 -罗伯特·梅普尔索普是谁
- You're welcome. - Who's Robert Mapplethorp?

523
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,280
实际上 我得把那个拿回来 不好意思
Actually, I'm gonna need that one back. Sorry.

524
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:25,980
没关系
That's okay.

525
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,500
我今年真正想要的就是一个胖胖狗之家
All I really wanted this year was a Puppy Pound.

526
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,280
给 我的可以给你
Here. You can have mine.

527
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:32,460
可好玩了
It's really fun.

528
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:33,240
我的天啊
Oh, my gosh.

529
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:34,940
这是我见到过最感人的事了
That's the sweetest thing I've ever seen!

530
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:37,880
莉莉 宝贝儿 你这样做太好了
Lily, honey, that was so nice!

531
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:39,780
没事儿 我明天还会有一个
It's okay. I'll get one tomorrow.

532
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,360
那个 你知道吗 关于那个
Um, well, you know what? About that --

533
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,580
小卡 小卡
Cam? Cam?

534
00:18:43,589 --> 00:18:46,435
是玩具店打来的
Uh, that was a t-o-y s-t-o-r-e.

535
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,100
-怎么了 -有人退了一个胖胖狗之家
- What? - Someone returned their Puppy Pound.

536
00:18:49,620 --> 00:18:51,460
可我们在他们关门之前赶不过去
W-we can't get over there in time before the store closes!

537
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,280
等等 你知道谁就住那家店旁边吗
Wait, you know who lives right over there?

538
00:18:55,240 --> 00:19:00,840
不 不
Oh, no. No!

539
00:19:10,303 --> 00:19:11,462
马上就到
Almost there.

540
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:12,760
不
No.

541
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,020
不 为什么会这样
No! Why?!

542
00:19:13,194 --> 00:19:16,028
为什么
Why-y-y-y-y?!

543
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:22,380
事后诸葛亮一下 那支烟是个错误
In hindsight, the cigar was a mistake.

544
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:24,520
那我们现在怎么办
So, what do we do now?

545
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:25,900
我们回家吧
We go home.

546
00:19:26,420 --> 00:19:27,640
我以为普里契特家的人是不会放弃的
I thought Pritchetts never give up.

547
00:19:27,660 --> 00:19:28,960
他们知道什么时候应该放手
They know when to give up,

548
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,580
也算是某种战胜自我
which is its own kind of victory.

549
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:32,600
-除非 -怎么了
- Unless... - what?

550
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,640
算了 太疯狂了
No it's crazy.

551
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,100
除非
Unless...

552
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:37,960
你真的想我再问一遍吗
Are you really gonna make me ask you again?

553
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:41,200
我们可以想办法给树干上的斧头施加压力
...we somehow apply pressure to the axhead already in the tree.

554
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,440
可以用车上的千斤顶
I bet we can use the jack from the car.

555
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:45,480
不错 向上的力可以撕裂树干
Of course. The upward motion will split the trunk. Yeah.

556
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:53,420
我们可以跟别人说我们是那么做的
We can always tell people that's how we did it.

557
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:55,820
我们就是那么做到的
That is how we did it.

558
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,060
人们总喜欢得到新东西
People love getting new things...

559
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:02,020
不过最好的东西背后都有个故事
But the best stuff has a story behind it.

560
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:03,140
超棒的树
Damn fine tree.

561
00:20:03,335 --> 00:20:04,987
只是锯子还卡在树上
Except the saw's still stuck in the truck.

562
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,060
你要负责不让你弟弟靠近那个
Yeah, you're gonna want to keep your brother away from that, huh?

563
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:11,540
很多时候 只有当我们失去了之后
A lot of times, it's only after we get rid of something...

564
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:12,240
有我的位置吗
Room for me?

565
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:15,600
才意识到自己有多怀念
...that we realize how much we miss it.

566
00:20:17,894 --> 00:20:19,573
真好
Oh! Nice!

567
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:20,847
干得不错 卢克
Good job, Luke!

568
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,760
好棒 胖胖狗之家
Yay! A Puppy Pound!

569
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:27,640
看起来没什么价值的东西
And things that seem worthless

570
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:29,880
突然就变得很有价值
suddenly turn out to be super valuable...

571
00:20:31,220 --> 00:20:32,960
大家一起到圣诞树前合影
Okay, everybody, picture in front of the tree.

572
00:20:32,970 --> 00:20:34,029
定好时间了 准备好了吗
Timer's set. Ready?

573
00:20:34,039 --> 00:20:35,415
什么 不
What? No!

574
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:41,200
甚至是宝贵
...maybe even precious...

575
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,840
所以我才觉得我们也许
Which is why I thought getting rid of this stuff

576
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:45,100
不应该把这些丢掉
would be a huge mistake.

577
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:46,800
得了吧
Nice try.

578
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:48,440
你欠我们六个星期的补贴
You still owe us six weeks' allowance,

579
00:20:48,620 --> 00:20:49,440
还有烟花
and the fireworks.

580
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,440
你居然把事情搞砸了
How could you screw this up?

581
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,280
你说什么
What?

582
00:20:58,120 --> 00:21:00,660
我们温哥华见
I'll see you in Vancouver, eh?

583
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,200
不对 卢克 再学一遍口音
No. Luke, do the accent again?

584
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:03,540
你还在跑着呢
Oh, are you on that machine?

585
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:05,800
对 朱莉安娜 但跟你老公不同的是
Yes, Juliana, but unlike your husband,

586
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,920
我会在你反应过来之前就完事的
I'll be finished before you know it.

587
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:10,300
你知道吗 这样其实更轻松了
You know what? It's actually easier this way!

588
00:21:10,397 --> 00:21:11,147
不知道能不能给这个动作申请专利
Wonder if you could patent a movement?

589
00:21:11,152 --> 00:21:12,124
就叫"菲式旋转"
Call it "Fliptical" --

590
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:24,360
爸 小朋友们来要糖果了
Dad, trick or treaters!

591
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:25,280
我们的糖发完了
We're out of candy!

592
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,940
这个爸爸是谁
Who is this dad?

593
00:21:27,460 --> 00:21:28,660
我是甘道夫
I'm Gandalf.

594
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:30,510
我来啦
Who's on?
